@startuml
[*] --> Inventory_Idle : Initial State
Inventory_Idle -->|User adds new goods|> Adding_Goods : Add Goods to Inventory
Inventory_Idle -->|User updates price|> Updating_Price : Update Price of Existing Items
Inventory_Idle -->|Goods expire|> Expired_Goods : Remove Expired Goods from Inventory
Inventory_Idle -->|User places order|> Placing_Order : Place Order for Additional Goods
Adding_Goods -->|Successful addition|> Inventory_Idle : Add Goods to Inventory Complete
Updating_Price -->|Successful update|> Inventory_Idle : Update Price of Existing Items Complete
Expired_Goods -->|Successful removal|> Inventory_Idle : Remove Expired Goods from Inventory Complete
Placing_Order --> Generating_Invoice : Place Order and Generate Invoice
Generating_Invoice -->|Order complete|> Inventory_Idle : Order Complete
Inventory_Idle --> Searching_for_Items : Search for Items Available in Inventory
Searching_for_Items --> Calculating_Discount_Tax : Select Items for Purchase
Calculating_Discount_Tax --> Generating_Receipt : Customer Completes Purchase
Generating_Receipt -->|Receipt complete|> Transaction_Complete : Receipt Complete
Transaction_Complete --> [*] : Final State

Inventory_Idle -->|User replaces item or cancels receipt|> Replacing_Item_Canceling_Receipt : Replace Item or Cancel Receipt During Billing
Replacing_Item_Canceling_Receipt --> Inventory_Idle : Replace Item or Cancel Receipt Complete
Inventory_Idle --> Recording_Customer_Requests : Record Customer Requests for Items Not Currently Available

Transaction_Complete --> [*] : Final State
@enduml
